sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Auditor
    participant C as Controller
    participant S as Audit records
    participant W as Worker
    H->>C: Approve questions on snapshot A
    C->>W: Dispatch with A and limited grant
    H->>C: Record revised assumption B
    C->>S: Commit B and mark dependents stale
    C->>W: Suspend affected work or retain A-only output
    W->>C: Submit evidence for A
    C->>S: Preserve historical evidence for A
    H->>C: Attempt acceptance of earlier packet
    C-->>H: Revision conflict, show affected premise
    H->>C: Authorize review under B
    C->>W: New context and attempt
    W->>C: New evidence and remaining limits
    C-->>H: Current packet for adjudication
